"As the remix took off, I became increasingly uncomfortable with its
separation from the underlying situation. A woman was sexually
assaulted and her brother was rightfully upset. People online seemed
to be laughing at him and not with him (because he wasn't laughing),
as Dodson fulfilled multiple stereotypes in one short news segment.
Watching the wider Web jump on this meme, all but forgetting why
Dodson was upset, seemed like a form of =91class tourism.=92 Folks with no
exposure to the projects could dip their toes into YouTube and get a
taste. [...] The creativity unleashed has been amazing, and what
mitigates my fears of people minimizing the gravity of the situation
is how Antoine himself has responded and taken charge of his own
meme."
